<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sun Micro a hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sun Micro a hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said it initiated coverage of Sun Microsystems with a hold recommendation.</p>
<p>-- Analyst was not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>-- Sun shed 3/8 to 58-5/8 in morning Nasdaq trade.</p>
